                                "format": "text/html",
                                "value": "<p>[fol. 441r]</p><p>Cong<em>regati</em>o DD. Pictoru<em>m</em><span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Die Dominico vigesimo primo septembris 1625</p><p></p><p>Fuit facta Congregatio Academiae Ill.riu<em>m</em> DD. Pictorem Urbis in Ec-<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>clesia Sancti Luca<em>e</em> nuncupat<em>a</em> sit<em>a</em> Romae in q.d d<em>ict</em>a Campo vac-<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>cina, in qua quidem Ecclesia, et Congre<em>ga</em>tione resp<em>ecti</em>ve Interfue-<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>runt, et Intervenerunt omnes singuli Infra<em>scri</em>pti v<em>ide</em>l<em>ice</em>t<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Per Ill.ris D'nus Simon Vouet Gallus ipsoru<em>m</em> DD. Pictorum Academia<em>e</em><span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Princeps.<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Ill.ris D'nus Nicolaus de Faggis secundus Consilarius<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D'nus Laurentius Consala Camerarius.<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D'nus Horatius Riminaldus censor.<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D'nus Petrus Ferrus censor.<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D'nus Ascanius Barigionus Provisor<em>is</em><span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D'nus Bartholomeus Balduccius aestimator.<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D'nus Federicus Gurter provisor Studii.<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D'nus Antonius Longus Curator forestarium.<sup>[1]</sup><span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D'nus Eques Pulidorus Falidonius.<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D'nus Gismundus Traccius<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D'nus Iacobus Gal[l]us</p><p></p><p>[1]&nbsp;Uncertain.</p>"
                            }
