                                "value": "<p>[fol. 441v]</p><p>D'nus Petrus Paulus Continus.<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D'nus Iacobus de Homine.<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D'nus Stephanus de Blasiis.<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D'nus Simon Ambrosius.<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D'nus Franciscus Piccinus.<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D'nus Franciscus de Clericis.<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D'nus Franciscus Maestrinus.<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D'nus Vincentius Sabatius.<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D'nus Antonius de Luttis.<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D'nus Angelus Brovonus.<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D'nus Io: Bap'ta de Grassis<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D'nus Petrus Paulus de Bellottis<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D'nus Ioannes Pintus.<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D'nus Bartholomeus Bombellus<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D'nus Antonius de Soria.<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D'nus Augustinus Ranuccius.<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D'nus Luca de Luca.<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D'nus Petrus de Angelis<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D'nus Marcus Antonius Aliprantis<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D'nus Ioannes de Giltris<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Quibus sic ut supra congregatis, ac In ordine dispositis, fuit pro</p>"
